      "message": "This is not correct.  The SoC specific Kconfig (CONFIG_CROS_SHI_NPCX or CONFIG_CROS_SHI_IT8XXX2) automatically gets enabled when PLATFORM_EC_HOST_INTERFACE_SHI.  Each driver SoC driver automatically selects the correct node from the compatible string.\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/bb733b03/zephyr/drivers/cros_shi/cros_shi_npcx.c#6\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/bb733b03/zephyr/drivers/cros_shi/cros_shi_it8xxx2.c#6",
